# The KALEIDO visualizer (second on the SELECT dial; it replaced the tunnel): curves of the spectrum, mirrored four ways, trailing and turning.
seed 0
wait 3000
tap HOME
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 31
spin SELECT 1
wait 7000
expect view 31
shot viz_kaleido.png
spin SELECT 1
wait 3000
shot viz_bars2.png
